Package: service-maestro-server
Version: @VERSION@
Section: web
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: adduser, ca-certificates, git, openssl, systemd
Recommends: git-lfs, openssh-client
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Maintainer: Service Maestro <phedders@users.noreply.github.com>
Description: self-hosted church service presentation server
 Service Maestro manages songs, set lists, Bible passages, media, displays and
 live service control. This package bundles its Node.js runtime and installs a
 systemd service with a local HTTPS certificate, data directories and first-run
 administrator credentials.
